            "text": "Airflow drops steadily as the HEPA filter clogs, so the purifier delivers less and less clean air even though it sounds like it is working. Carbon stops absorbing odors entirely once saturated. In a damp room, an old filter can start growing mold and blow musty air. Eventually the purifier is mostly just a fan using electricity."
